# Do not test until asked

After a code change, stop. Do not verify it unless the user explicitly asks you to test, typecheck, lint, build, or run the app.

- Do not run `tsc`, `npm test`, `npm run lint`, `npm run build`, or any similar check.
- Do not start a dev server, open a browser, take screenshots, or curl the app.
- Report what changed and leave verification until the user requests it.

```text
❌ BAD — after editing a service
Run `npx tsc --noEmit` to confirm the change compiles.

✅ GOOD — after editing a service
Describe the change and stop.
```

When the user asks to test, run only the check they asked for.
